## Q2

No deadlock and no skipped `done`. The background writes the final status after a lock attempt capped at 10 seconds (`detach.rs:1041-1046`, `:1317-1324`), including when the lock was not acquired. Bookkeeping drops the orchestrator lock at `mod.rs:3460-3462`, and `run_live` returns before that final write.

The staged-list refusal is passable by making `git diff --cached --name-only` succeed. `--allow-secret` still exempts a real path (`secret_gate.rs:85-87`). The message at `finish/mod.rs:308-325` says so.

The post-last-turn compare refreshes tree, brief, and artifacts (`mod.rs:4758-4777`). A brief edit during a continuation is visible there.

`patch_routing_picked` still drops a failed `to_bytes` or `write_text_atomic` with no line (`run.rs:2412-2417`). That leaves build-time `routing.picked` in place. It does not stick the panel on `running`.

